SUMMARY:Spring Renewal: Sound Frequency Healing with Gongs & Vibrations
DESCRIPTION:Step into a deeply immersive evening of sound\, stillness\, and renewal. \n\n\n\nJoin us for our April Sound Frequency Journey\, a restorative 90-minute experience designed to help you relax\, reset your nervous system\, and reconnect with your inner calm. \n\n\n\nLed by multi-instrumental sound practitioner Ryan Bright\, this session weaves together:✨ Gong bath meditation✨ Harmonic sound therapy✨ Vocal toning✨ Elemental healing frequencies \n\n\n\nWhether you’re brand new to sound healing or looking to support an ongoing wellness practice\, this experience offers a welcoming space to unwind\, release stress\, and restore balance. \n\n\n\n🧘‍♀️ No experience needed — just bring yourself(Feel free to bring a blanket and water for extra comfort) \n\n\n\n🌿 Come rest\, reset\, and renew. \n\n\n\n🎟 Reserve your spot today
URL:https://visitlancastercity.com/event/spring-renewal-sound-frequency-healing-with-gongs-vibrations/
LOCATION:Inspire Wellness Collective\, 226 North Arch Street\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Classes and Workshops
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitlancastercity.com/wp-content/uploads/Red-and-White-Modern-Meet-Our-New-Team-LinkedIn-Post-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
