SUMMARY:The Body in the Room: Using Somatic Awareness in Clinical Practice
DESCRIPTION:Your clients’ bodies are speaking in every session—are you listening? \n\n\n\nJoin Karen Carnabucci\, LCSW\, TEP for a dynamic\, experiential training designed for licensed clinicians. This 3-hour workshop explores the somatic signals\, relational cues\, and nervous system data that often go unspoken in clinical work. \n\n\n\nGrounded\, practical\, and accessible\, no prior somatic experience required. \n\n\n\n✨ You’ll learn how to: \n\n\n\n\nUse your own body as a source of clinical insight\n\n\n\nTrack your client’s nervous system state with more ease\n\n\n\nIntegrate somatic awareness into any clinical orientation\n\n\n\nApply a body-forward lens in case consultation\n\n\n\n\nWalk away with tools you can start using right away in your sessions. \n\n\n\n🎟 Register now—limited spots available
URL:https://visitlancastercity.com/event/the-body-in-the-room-using-somatic-awareness-in-clinical-practice/
LOCATION:Inspire Wellness Collective\, 226 North Arch Street\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Classes and Workshops
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitlancastercity.com/wp-content/uploads/body-in-the-room_orig.jpg
END:VEVENT
