DESCRIPTION:40 Original Paintings. \n\n\n\nFeaturing Paintings by  Tom Zayatz\, Jan Warner Zayatz and Stuart Kendig who are paint artists from York Pennsylvania. They each have their own painting styles and visions. They want to share some of their work with you for your enjoyment and amusement. \n\n\n\nMay1\, – May 30\, 2026 Opening Reception 1st Friday – May 1\, 5pm-8pm. Refreshments will be served.Also open for Lancaster ArtWalk – May 16\, 10am-5pm & May 17\, noon-4pm. Refreshments will be served.
