SUMMARY:Salsa & Bachata at Binns Park
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to turn up the heat at Salsa & Bachata 360: A First Friday Takeover at Binns Park in Lancaster! Join us on May 1\, 2026 from 5:00–8:30 PM for an evening of music\, movement\, and community as we kick off the season with the high-energy “Central DJ Island” experience. This free\, family-friendly event brings the rhythm to the heart of the city with live DJ sets\, guided dance instruction\, and an open-air social dance party. \n\n\n\nThe fun starts at 5:00 PM\, with kids’ classes (all ages) at 6:30 PM\, adult salsa and bachata basics at 7:00 PM\, and open social dancing from 7:30–8:30 PM. Whether you’re stepping onto the dance floor for the first time or you’ve been dancing for years\, come celebrate First Friday with vibrant beats\, welcoming vibes\, and nonstop energy.
URL:https://visitlancastercity.com/event/salsa-bachata-at-binns-park/
LOCATION:Binns Park\, 120 N Queen St\, Lanacaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:First Friday,Free Events and Activites,Music and Dance
ORGANIZER;CN="RCM":MAILTO:rcmrumba@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
