DESCRIPTION:First Fridays at Keel are back—chiller than ever. \n\n\n\nThe weather’s warming up\, the city’s alive\, and our doors are open.Come hang for porch vibes\, drinks\, and the community we love bringing together. \n\n\n\nFor May\, we’re hosting:Knotting TidesThe Sugar StudioClaire (tiny tattoos)maybe a little more… we’ll see 😉 \n\n\n\nAnd yes—build-your-own bouquet bar 💐 \n\n\n\nStop in. Stay a while.
