SUMMARY:Lancaster Improv’s First Friday Free For All
DESCRIPTION:Two bite size shows followed by an improv jam where YOU can take the stage! \n\n\n\nTwo teams give you a taste of what improv can be\, then you take the stage to show them how it’s done! Whether you’re a storied veteran of the stage\, or a doing improv comedy for the first time\, you’ll be supported by the evening’s coach in attempting games and scenes. \n\n\n\nJoin us for a casual night out in downtown Lancaster City that will have you rolling in the aisles…well\, aisle! \n\n\n\nFREE to all! BYOB \n\n\n\nJam will start approximately at 8:30.
URL:https://visitlancastercity.com/event/lancaster-improvs-first-friday-free-for-all-2/
