SUMMARY:West Jewels Gem Fest
DESCRIPTION:Calling all rock hounds! Do you love gemstones and fossils? Are you crazy for collecting minerals? Come to the West Jewels neighborhood on May 2 for Gem Fest! Learn about\, celebrate\, and trade rocks! \n\n\n\nEmily the Geologist will present on rock identification\, Fisher the Naturalist will present on fossils! Plus: paint a rock for the community garden\, browse rock-related books\, swap rocks for your collection\, and a FREE ROCK for everybody while supplies last!
URL:https://visitlancastercity.com/event/west-jewels-gem-fest/
