DESCRIPTION:A community-wide conspiracy designed to bring laughter to Lancaster \n\n\n\nJoin us for a casual night out in downtown Lancaster City that will have you rolling in the aisles…well\, aisle! \n\n\n\nGO BULLDOGSIt’s tradition around these parts that whenever you hear someone say “Go Bulldogs!”\, you have to reply “GO BULLDOGS!” GBD is Lancaster Improv Players longest running team; each show is a randomized selection of players from our entire community of students\, coaches\, and performers. that means once you finish an improv course at LIP\, you can be a Bulldog\, too! \n\n\n\nBYOB \n\n\n\nPay What You Will \n\n\n\nDoors at 6:45PM\, show at 7:00PM
