SUMMARY:Saturday Night Improv: Indie Mixtape
DESCRIPTION:Independent improv teams mix it up on the Lancaster Improv Players’ stage! \n\n\n\nAn evening of chuckles\, giggles\, guffaws\, and snorts provided by local indie teams! \n\n\n\nBut you may be asking. . . what is an “indie team”? \n\n\n\nAn indie team is an improv team that forms outside of the traditional means; sometimes they start as practice or study groups\, and sometimes they are formed around specific ideas or formats. Typically\, the terminology is used to differentiate from a ‘house team’\, which is a team started through an improv theater.
